stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connected
    Connected --> Sending: request bytes
    Sending --> ReadOnly: shutdown write
    ReadOnly --> ReadOnly: reply bytes
    ReadOnly --> Finished: incoming EOF
    Connected --> Failed: I/O error
    Sending --> Failed: I/O error
    ReadOnly --> Failed: I/O error
    Failed --> [*]
    Finished --> [*]
